namespace pdg { /**
\fn pdg::Animated::changeCenterOffsetBy(Offset value, number durationSeconds, int easing)
\brief Animate the rotation-center offset by a delta.

Adds to the pivot offset. With andThen(), the delta is applied to the offset when the operation starts. Durations are explicit floating-point seconds. Zero applies immediately; a request after wait() or andThen() must have positive duration.

\param value Relative pivot delta in the owning object coordinate system.
\param durationSeconds Finite nonnegative duration in seconds.
\param easing Integer easing constant; elapsed time and duration use seconds.

\return This object, for chaining.

\see setCenterOffset(), changeCenterOffsetTo()
*/

/**
\fn pdg::Animated::changeCenterOffsetBy(number x, number y, number durationSeconds, int easing)
\brief Animate the rotation-center offset by a delta.

Adds to the pivot offset. With andThen(), the delta is applied to the offset when the operation starts. Durations are explicit floating-point seconds. Zero applies immediately; a request after wait() or andThen() must have positive duration.

\param x Relative pivot delta in the owning object coordinate system.
\param y Relative pivot delta in the owning object coordinate system.
\param durationSeconds Finite nonnegative duration in seconds.
\param easing Integer easing constant; elapsed time and duration use seconds.

\return This object, for chaining.

\see setCenterOffset(), changeCenterOffsetTo()
*/
 }
